**Flags**
- **Price chips and public claims.** The price chips are a menu. Any chip he ticks becomes a public claim, for example "ההגעה בחינם". The brief requires chips, so I kept them. The confirm-facts screen is what makes this safe, so please make sure every ticked chip shows up there as its own `FACT_TYPE_PRICE_RULE` item.
- **Button pattern.** Buttons use the infinitive throughout (לתקן / להוריד / לשמור / לבנות / להמשיך). The two exceptions are "נכון" and "זהו, סיימתי", which are his own words at the moment of confirming.

